>**{c=red:If you have any other }{n:Borghertz's|Borghertz}{c=red: Hands quest active, you must complete that one before you can start this quest!}**
=2 Walkthrough
Travel to the Durable Shields shop in {z:Upper Jeuno} and speak with {n:Guslam} located at (H-8) on {p:Thief} to begin the quest.
* Go to {z:Davoi}, then travel to {z:Monastic Cavern}, and locate a {p:Treasure Coffer}.
* Either obtain a {i:Davoi Coffer Key|Davoi Coffer Key|1042} to open it, or pick the lock.
** You do not need to be on Thief when opening the coffer.
* You will receive {@k} {k:Old gauntlets} from the coffer.
* Return to {z:Upper Jeuno} and speak to {n:Guslam} inside the Durable Shields shop. He will state he's unable to repair the gauntlets.
* If this is your first AF you must do the following, otherwise skip these steps:
** Speak to {n:Deadly Minnow} inside of the Durable Shields shop.
** Head to {z:Lower Jeuno} inside the Tenshodo area. Speak with {n:Yin Pocanakhu} at (J-8) and then trade 1,000 {p:Gil} to continue.
* Go to {z:Port Jeuno} and head to the crates near the Auction House and Duty-Free Shop at (H-8).
* Click on the **???** toolbox atop the crates to receive a cutscene.
* Travel to {z:Castle Zvahl Baileys} and go to (F-8) on the first map.
* Click on one of the torches to spawn {m:Dark Spark}.
* Once {m:Dark Spark} is defeated, examine one of the torches for {@k} {k:Shadow flames}.
* Return to Port Jeuno and examine the **???** again. After the cutscene, the quest is complete.

=2 Two Additional Coffers
{n:Guslam} mentions that there is still armor scattered about Vana'diel. You can find two more pieces of armor by opening coffers in the following zones with the corresponding coffer key:
* {z:Castle Oztroja} - {@i:Rogue's Culottes|14219} {i:Rogue's Culottes|Rogue's Culottes|14219}
* {z:Castle Zvahl Baileys} - {@i:Rogue's Vest|12643} {i:Rogue's Vest|Rogue's Vest|12643}
** These coffers are not required to complete the quest, therefore after you receive your hands the quest is "completed".
** The quest must either be active or completed in order to receive these attire pieces.
** You **must** have {p:Thief} as your main job when you open these coffers.

